abstract: >-
  Aggregate observational research pipeline with temporal splits, synthetic
  tests, and an exploratory metadata-only engagement analysis. No Reddit data
  or per-user predictions are distributed. The release is awaiting author
  review and is not a peer-reviewed publication.
